contentText:
Premios Juventud unveiled the first lineup of performers for its 2026 edition, Billboard can exclusively announce Thursday (Aug. 13).&nbsp;&nbsp;

The first wave of confirmed names are Ana Mena, Christian Nodal, Elvis Crespo, Farruko, Greeicy, Juan Magán, Marc Anthony, Mau y Ricky, Quevedo and DJ Rous.&nbsp;

